      "updated": 1791283709269,
      "created": 1791199330803,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1.  \ni) target -> which version of js use / get output compiled\nii) module -> sets the module system of complied js\niii) allowjs -> allow the js within urproject or not (just ts)\niv) strict -> enable all strict checking \n\nand a bunch other stuff related to ts -> js (conversion\nrelated)",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1.  \ni) target -> which version of js use / get output compiled\nii) module -> sets the module system of complied js\niii) allowjs -> allow the js within urproject or not (just ts)\niv) strict -> enable all strict checking \n\nand a bunch other stuff related to ts -> js (conversion related)",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
