      "updated": 1791483494993,
      "created": 1791285563373,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "4. null vs undefined ->  both means empty rn\n\n   i) null and undefiled are unique types on there own \n          just like number and string is a type \n            \n   ii) null -> null makes variable type to \"any\"\n                   but will get type with first assignment\n\n    iii) json -> understands \"null\" & don't \"undefined\" -> \n            null = vipe the curr values to nothing\n           undefined = no change by def -> no field in json \n    \n    iv) default vals in js/ts -> only trigger by undefined \n\nv) null -> setted by user || undefined -> unsetted rn by js ",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "4. null vs undefined ->  both means empty rn\n\n   i) null and undefiled are unique types on there own \n          just like number and string is a type \n            \n   ii) null -> null makes variable type to \"any\"\n                   but will get type with first assignment\n\n    iii) json -> understands \"null\" & don't \"undefined\" -> \n            null = vipe the curr values to nothing\n           undefined = no change by def -> no field in json \n    \n    iv) default vals in js/ts -> only trigger by undefined \n\nv) null -> setted by user || undefined -> unsetted rn by js ",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
