      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1) any type -> don't mix it up with primitive from chunk 1 \n\n    any is like u rn don't know what type its gonna be \n        so any says -> compiler trust me \n            i can be anything so let me use any operation \n                on variable and don't throw complie time eror\n                  code'll compil but for wrng op throw runtime",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1) any type -> don't mix it up with primitive from chunk 1 \n\n    any is like u rn don't know what type its gonna be \n        so any says -> compiler trust me \n            i can be anything so let me use any operation \n                on variable and don't throw complie time eror\n                  code'll compil but for wrng op throw runtime",
